[statement]
A package that conflicts with itself competes for a name as any other, and
is installed only where it ranks first: `e` provides `c` at 2, below `c` 3,
and apk installs `c` 3
(`a-package-conflicting-with-itself-is-still-chosen`).

[repository]
P:c
V:3

P:e
V:2
p:e c=2

[request]
c

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install c 3
